  death in an emotional statement to ET  reflecting on her husband's Life and  Legacy I have the sweetest husband in  the entire world quote we love you we  miss you and I will always Save the Last  Dance For You which is sometimes fun  like to have a partner in life that I  can also dance with you know it just  makes every single day so fun according  to deadline twitch and Allison had a big  lineup of projects slated for the new  year they were in the process of  developing their own show called living  the dream which would help first-time  buyers find a home they were also  working on a show at HGTV where they  would oversee construction of a  full-sized Malibu Barbie Dream House  filming was scheduled to begin in  January while it's unclear if the show  will move forward HGTV said in a  statement they're considering different  scenarios but for now their primary  focus remains on way wishing their best  to Allison and the entire Boss family  during this difficult time  [Music]
 

